# One-time behavior-freeze corpus handed to zot for its port off pkg/local
# (zot issue #29). Generated here, delivered by rsync, deliberately not part
# of sci's history. The generator stays alongside it so the corpus can be
# regenerated while the port is live:
#     ZOT_HANDOFF_OUT=testdata/zot-handoff just test-pkg ./pkg/local -run TestWriteZotHandoffGoldens
# Both go away once zot's dependency guard is green.
pkg/local/testdata/zot-handoff/
pkg/local/zothandoff_test.go
